==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈd̥auːɪn]|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
Past participle of ''[[deyja]]'' meaning "to [[die]]", used like an adjective to mean "[[dead]]".

===Adjective===
'''dáinn''' {{m}}, [[dáin]] {{f}}, [[dáið]] {{n}}

# [[dead]]

====Synonyms====
* (''dead''): [[dauður]] {{m}}, [[látinn]] {{m}}

